    /*-----Personality traits range from 1-500 and change via choices-----*/
    /*---Openness: High equals explorative, broad range of interests, curious---*/
    /*---Conscientiousness: High equals reliable and goal driven---*/
    /*---Extraversion: High equals social and talkative, likes company and friends---*/
    /*---Agreeableness: High equals trustworthy, kind, caring, honest---*/
    /*---Neuroticism: High equals easily stressed, moody, and irritable---*/

